ng` is 154,053,237 bytes. The batch log is `target/d1-r9b-batch-2.log` and the reopen check is `target/d1-r9b-check-2.log`. The check was run using `java -cp \"$(clojure -Spath -A:test)\" clojure.main target/d1-r9b-check.clj`; two preliminary attempts accidentally invoked the test alias's broad default suite and were interrupted, so they are not completed test results. The frozen table SHA-256 remains `e435ac4072ba0a3c278fbe91918d22184b43f0a8d6c1e397c09f68dd629beb75`.\n\nNo code was changed in this continuation. No Jupiter bounds declaration, tagged lane, corpus correspondence record, verification result, or companion has been completed. No commit was made. Preserve both scratch paths together; the configured next batch remains 25 fixtures. The previous red-first and kondo results above describe the preexisting changes, not new tests from this continuation. The r9 verifier and provenance limitations remain open.\nd1-corpus :nbe-delta :pass 14536 ms 2411488 bytes 69 sites\nd1-corpus :normalize-opaque :pass 27451 ms 6480757 bytes 202 sites\nd1-corpus :normalize-delta :pass 23567 ms 6025043 bytes 202 sites\nd1-corpus :beta-eq-true :pass 24550 ms 6297404 bytes 208 sites\nd1-corpus :beta-eq-false :pass 22769 ms 6053913 bytes 208 sites\nd1-corpus :beta-eq-three-arity :pass 24304 ms 6054077 bytes 208 sites\nd1-corpus :typing-type :pass 34643 ms 8836715 bytes 286 sites\nd1-corpus :typing-lambda :pass 32860 ms 8826157 bytes 286 sites\nd1-corpus :typing-unknown :pass 31998 ms 8825407 bytes 286 sites\nd1-corpus :typing-kind :pass 31878 ms 8825411 bytes 286 sites\nd1-corpus :typing-ascription :pass 32335 ms 8826535 bytes 286 sites\nd1-corpus :type-of-valid :pass 33827 ms 8985517 bytes 291 sites\n\nRan 1 tests containing 9 assertions.\n0 failures, 0 errors.\nLoading initial Timbre config from: :default\n{:summary {:fixture-count 155, :pass 33, :refused 0, :not-run 122}, :reopened-addresses-checked 198}\n      1 codex-linux-sandbox --sandbox-policy-cwd /home/sto/workspace/datomwo